 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A triangle mesh defined by vertices $V$ and faces $F$ [S1][S4, unofficial].
-*   **Output:** A set of occupied voxel coordinates (sparse grid) [S1][S3, unofficial], or a generated mesh of cubes/point cloud representing the voxelized surface [S2, S4, unofficial].
+*   **Input:** A triangle mesh defined by vertices $V$ and faces $F$ [S1][S2, unofficial].
+*   **Parameters:** Voxel size $vs = (v_x, v_y, v_z)$, voxel origin $origin$ (typically $[0,0,0]$), and a precision factor $p$ to reduce artifacts [S1][S2, S4, unofficial].
+*   **Output:** A set of occupied voxel coordinates (integer indices $ijk$) or a generated mesh of cubes representing the voxelized surface [S1][S4, unofficial].
 
